secubox-openclaw (1.0.1-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Phase 7 (#498) fix : postinst chowns /var/lib/secubox/openclaw to
    secubox:secubox 0755 (parent) / 0750 (scans) — was root:root 0750
    which prevented the aggregator user (secubox) from traversing the
    parent during api/main.py's import-time mkdir of scans/.

